OL,3,GNEWSAPoison GP loses bid to withdraw
OL,4,Aattempt murder plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ex-GP imprisoned for trying to
OL,7,Fpoison his mother's partner with a fake
OL,8,FCovid jab has lost his bid to withdraw
OL,9,Fhis guilty plea to a second murder
OL,10,Fattempt on the same man.
OL,12,FThomas Kwan, 55, was previously jailed
OL,13,Ffor more than 31 years for going in
OL,14,Fdisguise to Patrick O'Hara's Newcastle
OL,15,Fhome and injecting him with a toxic
OL,16,Fchemical under the pretence of giving a
OL,17,Fvaccination.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
