OL,3,GNEWSAPoison GP loses bid to withdraw
OL,4,Aattempt murder plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FKwan, who lived in Ingleby Barwick,
OL,7,Flater admitted sending bottles of
OL,8,Falcohol laced with thallium to O'Hara
OL,9,Fin the months before the January 2024
OL,10,Fmurder attempt.
OL,12,FOn Thursday he sought to withdraw that
OL,13,Fplea claiming his second confession was
OL,14,Ffalse and made under duress, but a
OL,15,FNewcastle Crown Court judge rejected
OL,16,Fit.
